 # orders-svc
 Order intake for the shop. Python 3.11. Run tests with `pytest`.
 See docs/ for the runbook and partner integrations.
+
+Install test dependencies with `python3 -m pip install -r requirements-dev.txt`.
+Orders default to CNY; pass `currency="EUR"` for euro amounts in integer cents.
+See `docs/runbook.md` for the staged database and consumer rollout before enabling EUR.
